    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Lily Fantasia</i>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Lily Fantasia</i></strong> is a brand-new rhythm game with a piano theme!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge powerful foes in Story Mode using the black and white keys, or play freely in Practice Room Mode and enjoy performing your favorite tunes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the music and begin a journey that\u2019s truly your own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/e8ed8ea53e12aedc4265ab890796ae4e.poster.avif?t=1737100882\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/e8ed8ea53e12aedc4265ab890796ae4e.webm?t=1737100882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Magical World of <i>Lily Fantasia</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a magical world where mythical beings live alongside humans, you are a gifted but unrecognized pianist. To care for your sick mother, you gave up the path of a concert pianist. But as her health declines and hope begins to fade,\u00a0fate takes an unexpected turn.\u00a0A mysterious vampire named <strong><i>Lily</i></strong> appears before you, granting you the power of a magical piano and inviting you on a wondrous musical adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the magical piano, you must defeat powerful enemies and obtain the legendary elixir, the \u201cGolden Apple,\u201d to save your mother\u2019s life. But was this encounter mere chance or part of a greater plan? Is the power of the magical piano a blessing or a curse? Beneath the surface of the story lies an unsettling hint of mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth awaits\u2014only you can uncover it! </p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/d4805b8f8a5059ce7cddb49ee90aee7f.poster.avif?t=1737100882\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/d4805b8f8a5059ce7cddb49ee90aee7f.webm?t=1737100882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Practice Room Mode: Freedom to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Practice Room Mode, featuring Story Mode tracks with a unique <strong><i>parry mechanic</i></strong> and along with a carefully curated selection of tracks from around the world! Each song offers three difficulty levels and various challenge modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a beginner or a seasoned rhythm game pro, you\u2019ll find endless enjoyment in Lily\u2019s Practice Room!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/9882af54696b761776ada417252e5ec2.poster.avif?t=1737100882\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/9882af54696b761776ada417252e5ec2.webm?t=1737100882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rhythm game brought to life with a rich fantasy narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience music charts that move dynamically. (<i>Thanks to the magical piano!</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle three levels of difficulty and multiple challenge modes for every track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play songs with strategic parry mechanics or simply enjoy the thrill of performing music.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Lily Fantasia</i>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Lily Fantasia</i></strong> is a brand-new rhythm game with a piano theme!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge powerful foes in Story Mode using the black and white keys, or play freely in Practice Room Mode and enjoy performing your favorite tunes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the music and begin a journey that\u2019s truly your own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/e8ed8ea53e12aedc4265ab890796ae4e.poster.avif?t=1737100882\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/e8ed8ea53e12aedc4265ab890796ae4e.webm?t=1737100882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Magical World of <i>Lily Fantasia</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a magical world where mythical beings live alongside humans, you are a gifted but unrecognized pianist. To care for your sick mother, you gave up the path of a concert pianist. But as her health declines and hope begins to fade,\u00a0fate takes an unexpected turn.\u00a0A mysterious vampire named <strong><i>Lily</i></strong> appears before you, granting you the power of a magical piano and inviting you on a wondrous musical adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the magical piano, you must defeat powerful enemies and obtain the legendary elixir, the \u201cGolden Apple,\u201d to save your mother\u2019s life. But was this encounter mere chance or part of a greater plan? Is the power of the magical piano a blessing or a curse? Beneath the surface of the story lies an unsettling hint of mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth awaits\u2014only you can uncover it! </p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/d4805b8f8a5059ce7cddb49ee90aee7f.poster.avif?t=1737100882\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/d4805b8f8a5059ce7cddb49ee90aee7f.webm?t=1737100882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Practice Room Mode: Freedom to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Practice Room Mode, featuring Story Mode tracks with a unique <strong><i>parry mechanic</i></strong> and along with a carefully curated selection of tracks from around the world! Each song offers three difficulty levels and various challenge modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a beginner or a seasoned rhythm game pro, you\u2019ll find endless enjoyment in Lily\u2019s Practice Room!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/9882af54696b761776ada417252e5ec2.poster.avif?t=1737100882\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/9882af54696b761776ada417252e5ec2.webm?t=1737100882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rhythm game brought to life with a rich fantasy narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience music charts that move dynamically. (<i>Thanks to the magical piano!</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle three levels of difficulty and multiple challenge modes for every track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play songs with strategic parry mechanics or simply enjoy the thrill of performing music.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Welcome, to the fantastical and rhythmic world of\u300aLily Fantasia\u300b! Join the mysterious vampire, Lily, to save your mother in a race against time! Overcome fierce enemies, wield the magical piano, and claim your destiny as a Rhythm Master!",
